The data in this repository are an adapted work of the following datasets, each released under CC BY 4.0:

  LEEDR project home energy dataset, Loughborough University, https://doi.org/10.17028/rd.lboro.6176450.v1
  REFIT: Electrical Load Measurements (Cleaned), University of Strathclyde, https://doi.org/10.15129/9ab14b0e-19ac-4279-938f-27f643078cec
  UK-DALE, UK Energy Research Centre Energy Data Centre, https://doi.org/10.5286/UKERC.EDC.000001
  DARCK, Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17159850

The adapted data are released under the same license. You may share and adapt them for any purpose, provided that you give appropriate credit to this repository and to the original datasets above, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made. The changes made in this release are listed in README.md.

